# SCPN Tokamak Core — citation metadata
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you reference this repository, cite it as below. No release, version,
  or DOI exists yet; cite the repository state you inspected.
type: software
title: SCPN Tokamak Core
abstract: >-
  Governed device-family repository for conventional and spherical tokamak
  configurations within the SCPN Reactor Systems Research Group. Evidence
  maturity computational_prototype: a validated device configuration model,
  diagnostic and clock semantics aligned with the SCPN Phase Orchestrator
  observability catalogue, level-0 device physics closed forms, and
  tessellated and B-rep geometry models of a cylindrical periodic
  equivalent. All parameter sets are synthetic; no real machine is
  described, and the claim inventory is empty.
authors:
